
                       geant4-11-04-ref-05
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o New module for configuration and build of Doxygen docs for toolkit code.
 o Polished drawing methods of scorers; added options to refresh or overlay
   new scoring mesh.
 o In G4PhysicsModelCatalog, added the possibility to register
   custom/user-defined physics models.
 o In G4MTRunManager, added interface for initializing event seeds, enabling
   flexible integration with external schedulers without requiring additional
   code changes.
 o Refactored G4LEND to make GIDI+ an implementation detail.
   Made all GIDI+ headers private to G4LEND so they are not exposed to
   toolkit code or when installed.
 o Updated data set G4EMLOW-9.0.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(*)  Fixes included in patch release 11.4.2

